With ts_omit_logtail, skip log policy loading, log configuration creation,
log buffering, log directory discovery and logger initialization entirely. Without that tag, upstream
behavior is unchanged. This does not disable node state storage or other log
sinks: the wrapper separately sets both UserLogf and Logf to logger.Discard.
